// Counts one change of the document and answers the count: cell 1 of ed_typing is the number of primitive operations applied since ctl_new, which op_apply bumps for every edit, undo and redo alike, so a program that noted it can tell the document is not what it was.
ed_touch() {
  int[] pend = (import ed_typing);
  pend[1] = pend[1] + 1;
  int n = pend[1];
} return int n;
